mcp
├── when parsing a response
│   ├── it accepts plain json
│   ├── it accepts sse after unrelated events
│   └── it ignores malformed data
└── when probing an endpoint
    ├── it sends the initialize contract
    ├── it accepts an sse handshake
    ├── it rejects a missing session
    ├── it reports a protocol error
    ├── it reports an http error
    └── it propagates transport errors
